# LF in this tree, whatever the platform writes. Until now that was a sentence in CLAUDE.md and
# the habit of reading git diff --stat, which catches an accident only after it has happened.
# Cheapest to settle while the repository is small enough for it to change nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The installer's icon is the one binary in the tree. text=auto would detect it, but detection
# is a guess and an icon rewritten to LF is an icon no longer.
*.ico binary
